                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="0982-427b-1d4a-d07c">If a Dark Emissary is selected as a Compulsory HQ choice in an Allied Detachment that is part of an army with the Traitor Allegiance, then all models in the Allied Detachment with the Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus) special rule gain the Stubborn special rule.</characteristic>
