      <rules>
        <rule name="Dedicated Transport (Legion Whispercutter)" id="d3fc-5a72-8031-53ad" hidden="false">
          <description>A Legion Whispercutter has a Transport Capacity of 6 models. It may only carry models
with both the Infantry Unit Type and the Skirmish Sub-type.


A Legion Whispercutter may be purchased as a Dedicated Transport any unit with both
the Infantry Unit Type and the Skirmish Sub-type, composed of 5 models.


A Legion Whispercutter counts its entire hull as an access point.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
